      "id": "claim_462a24d55cb749a7a879c8bcd922fc57",
      "statement": "The investigation reaper mounts its dedicated EFS root access point at /mnt/efs and runs on an independent EventBridge schedule set by the investigation_reaper_schedule_hours Terraform variable (default 8 hours). With no matching running task, creation age beyond the grace period (investigation_grace_period_hours, default 168 hours) or missing CreatedAt makes an investigation eligible; a final task check precedes cleanup, and an existing directory requires a successful S3 backup under cluster/investigation/reaper-final-backup before directory deletion, access-point removal, and task-definition deregistration.",
